      "informal_statement": "Let $l$ be a filter on a type $\\beta$, $f : \\beta \\to \\alpha$ a function, and $y \\in \\alpha$. Then $f$ tends to $y$ along $l$ if and only if the extended distance $\\text{edist}(f(x), y)$ tends to $0$ along $l$."
